D = {}
D["ENV_CH03-INT-004_THE_FORGOTTEN_KITCHEN_V002.jpg"] = "Desaturated grey view of a stone-walled kitchen. A clay cooking pot sits on three stones over grey ash, herb bundles hang from a pole across the upper wall, a wooden doorway is at the back, a round grinding stone stands on a base at right, and an open doorway at left shows bare trees and pale ground outside."
D["ENV_CH03-INT-005_A_SLEEPING_ROOM_V002.jpg"] = "Dim, desaturated view into a small room through a doorway. A low wooden platform holds a folded cloth, cobwebs hang in the upper corners, a clay jar and a small bowl sit on the floor at right, and the doorframe fills the foreground."
D["ENV_CH03-SUB-005_A_RESIDENTIAL_COURTYARD_V002.jpg"] = "Desaturated grey view of a yard in falling grain. A mud wall at left has a line with two hanging cloths, one indigo and one striped. A thatched mud hut is at right with a stone mortar and pestle, two rolled mats leaning on the wall, and a small clay bird figure on the ground."
D["ENV_CH03-SUB-006_THE_BACK_PLOTS_V002.jpg"] = "Desaturated grey view of a yard. A thatched mud hut is at left, a hoe leans in muddy ground at centre, a wattle fence runs at right with a tipped clay jar at its foot, dead stalks and bare shrubs stand in the yard, and more thatched huts sit in the background under an overcast sky."
D["ENV_CH03-TRV-003_THE_NARROW_PASSAGES_V002.jpg"] = "Desaturated grey view of a narrow passage between two very high mud walls. Footprints cross a mound of sand in the ground, broken wall tops stand at the far end, and grain falls through the hazy air."
D["ENV_CH04-INT-001_A_FISHING_SHELTER_V002.jpg"] = "Painted view of an open-sided fishing shelter with a thatched roof on wooden posts. Woven baskets and a conical trap sit at left, a wooden board with a knife rests on the ground, nets hang from the roof beams, and a raised platform with a drying rack stands at right. A river and forested banks show beyond the posts."
D["ENV_CH04-INT-002_A_RIVERBANK_HOUSE_V002.jpg"] = "Painted view of a mud-walled house with a thatched roof on a riverbank. A small window is at left, and the open door shows a bed and fish hanging inside. Clay pots and baskets stand in front of the wall, a dugout canoe lies on the bank at lower right, and palms and a forested far bank sit beyond the water."
D["ENV_CH04-INT-003_THE_CANOE_SHED_V002.jpg"] = "Painted view of an open canoe shed with a thatched roof. Three dugout canoes rest on log supports, the nearest pale and with an adze laid across it, wood shavings cover the ground, and an axe with a long handle leans against a post at right. A river with trees beyond the posts is visible."
D["ENV_CH04-SET-002_THE_TWO_HOUSE_LANDING_V002.jpg"] = "Painted view of two thatched mud-walled houses on either side of a reddish earth path leading toward palms. A fish drying rack stands at right, and two dugout canoes sit in the water in the foreground."
